<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-month bill yield eases to 21.30 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-month bill yield eases to 21.30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of 91-day discount treasury bills was set by auction at 21.30 percent, down from 21.50 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     11,412.35 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    21.30 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     94.9574 pct</p>
</text>
